      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Moonwind Operating Manual",
      "notes": "The MIDI implementation's controller tables (PDF pages 52 - 54), read by tools/profiles/jomox/read-jomox-cc.mjs from Moonwind_E.pdf (sha256 f7915d4dba638cec7d5b475a7d8a4badff84f27f01b566acc33b0676d6bdb905), https://www.jomox.de/upload/manuals/Moonwind_E.pdf, linked from https://www.jomox.de/support.php?lang=2&product_id=15. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/jomox/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/jomox/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI implementation, sent as the controller it prints, on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "A value range named one each by the internal range beside it (`0/64  Off/On`) is a choice; values printed without names are a choice of those values; every other range is a number, its internal range or resolution in its description.",
    "MSB and LSB rows sent as one value over both controllers, the MSB first: Cutoff Left (CC 16 and 17, 0 - 511); Cutoff Right (CC 18 and 19, 0 - 511)."
  ],
